<title>USA: L. Luria starts liquidating 17 of 45 stores.</title>
<headline>L. Luria starts liquidating 17 of 45 stores.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI LAKES, Fla. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>L. Luria &amp; Son Inc said it started liquidating 17 of its 45 stores in an effort to streamline its merchandise and focus on performing stores.</p>
<p>After the sales are completed, the company will have 28 speciality stores, the company said.</p>
<p>The company said it hired Gordon Brothers Partners -- a Boston-based retail advisory chain -- to manage the sales.</p>
<p>The company's shares were unchanged today at 3.</p>
<p>L. Luria sells jewelry and gifts.</p>
